      "content": "I can't advise you to take additional medications or heavy sleep aids without consulting a doctor. Quetiapine can indeed cause insomnia as a side effect, and taking something else without medical supervision can be harmful and may interact with your existing medication. I recommend speaking with your prescribing doctor or a mental health professional about alternative sleep strategies and potential adjustments to your quetiapine dosage.",
